Package: ancemb
Type: Package
Title: Bayesian Ancestral Reconstruction of Protein Embeddings
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Angel Luis", "Robles Fernandez", , "a.l.robles.fernandez@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-4674-4270"))
  )
Description: Provides Bayesian phylogenetic reconstruction of ancestral protein
    embeddings using continuous-trait evolutionary models. Brownian Motion and
    Ornstein-Uhlenbeck processes are implemented as pre-compiled Stan models,
    and the package exports a small set of functions to prepare data, fit
    models, extract ancestral states, and compare model families. The
    accompanying test suite verifies the Stan posterior summaries against
    both pure-R reference implementations and phytools::fastAnc().
License: GPL (>= 3)
